00:13:15.120 --> 00:13:19.050
and how do we make it into
a more global movement,

00:13:19.050 --> 00:13:20.850
and what is the role of universities

00:13:20.850 --> 00:13:24.450
and academic institutions like
the Early Child Study Center

00:13:24.450 --> 00:13:26.640
in actually making that happen.

00:13:26.640 --> 00:13:28.470
