00:16:15.450 --> 00:16:18.840
And I wanted to have,
yes, give you a couple

00:16:18.840 --> 00:16:23.760
of ideas that are a bit of
a base for future lectures,

00:16:23.760 --> 00:16:27.300
but also for food for thought, right?

00:16:27.300 --> 00:16:29.730
So I wanted to concentrate in two things.

00:16:29.730 --> 00:16:32.940
The first of all is on science,

00:16:32.940 --> 00:16:37.940
and Dr. Rima Salah also
